WEBVTT

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:35.451
Support Admin Watch on
kissasia.cam or kisskh.org

00:01:27.905 --> 00:01:31.025
ADAPTED FROM THE NOVEL MY QUEEN
BY XIE LOUNAN

00:01:55.625 --> 00:01:56.745
It's hot.

00:01:57.865 --> 00:01:58.705
I'm fine.

00:01:59.305 --> 00:02:00.625
You're still smiling after all this?

00:02:02.825 --> 00:02:05.185
You care about me. That makes me happy.

00:02:09.345 --> 00:02:10.185
Where's your medicine?

00:02:13.185 --> 00:02:14.025
I've stopped using it.

00:02:14.945 --> 00:02:16.105
Stopped using it?

00:02:17.385 --> 00:02:18.545
I mean,

00:02:19.425 --> 00:02:21.425
I don't need it anymore. I took it.

00:02:21.505 --> 00:02:23.505
You took it,
and you're still not getting better.

00:02:24.185 --> 00:02:27.105
I'm really fine. I just need some sleep.

00:02:33.465 --> 00:02:35.185
You have reached Jiangzhou.

00:02:35.745 --> 00:02:37.065
Why did you come back?

00:02:40.945 --> 00:02:42.625
Why did you trick me into leaving?

00:02:45.225 --> 00:02:46.545
To keep you safe.

00:02:48.745 --> 00:02:50.505
You're the Emperor.

00:02:50.585 --> 00:02:52.745
Your life is more important
than my safety.

00:02:52.825 --> 00:02:54.545
Yes, I'm the Emperor,

00:02:55.345 --> 00:02:56.745
but I'm also your husband.

00:03:17.865 --> 00:03:20.145
Even if I can become
the Empress of the Great Qi again,

00:03:21.505 --> 00:03:23.945
I can never be
the Ling Cangcang that Bai Chifan likes.

00:03:30.385 --> 00:03:31.865
You haven't answered me

00:03:32.625 --> 00:03:33.665
why you came back.

00:03:36.465 --> 00:03:38.305
I didn't want to bear the blame
for causing your death.

00:03:40.105 --> 00:03:41.105
But I think

00:03:41.905 --> 00:03:43.105
you came back
because you worried about me.

00:03:45.305 --> 00:03:46.145
I didn't.

00:03:54.065 --> 00:03:55.745
-What are you doing?
-Stay still.

00:03:56.465 --> 00:03:57.385
I'm cold.

00:03:58.545 --> 00:03:59.665
Let me warm up a little.

00:04:53.505 --> 00:04:54.705
We humbly welcome Your Majesties' arrival.

00:04:56.465 --> 00:04:57.465
I failed in my duties,

00:04:57.545 --> 00:04:59.985
putting both
Your Majesty and Her Majesty in danger.

00:05:00.065 --> 00:05:02.105
Please punish me.

00:05:06.705 --> 00:05:07.545
Xiao Huan.

00:05:08.705 --> 00:05:09.545
Xiao Huan?

00:05:12.065 --> 00:05:13.145
Xiao Huan!

00:05:15.505 --> 00:05:17.745
Xiao Huan! Xiao Huan!

00:05:18.465 --> 00:05:20.345
Guards! Summon the Imperial Preceptor.

00:05:27.465 --> 00:05:28.305
Cangcang.

00:05:29.185 --> 00:05:30.025
Cangcang.

00:05:30.105 --> 00:05:31.785
I'm here. I'm here.

00:05:32.465 --> 00:05:33.545
Don't leave me.

00:05:35.905 --> 00:05:36.945
I won't.

00:05:38.185 --> 00:05:39.225
I'll always be with you.

00:05:51.425 --> 00:05:53.905
-Your Majesty.
-Please rise. Examine His Majesty.

00:06:14.025 --> 00:06:15.545
It's worse than I expected.

00:06:30.345 --> 00:06:31.185
What is this?

00:06:31.985 --> 00:06:33.585
You didn't listen to me.

00:06:41.185 --> 00:06:42.705
To save Your Majesty as fast as possible,

00:06:43.305 --> 00:06:44.665
His Majesty took the Yushu Pill

00:06:45.265 --> 00:06:46.865
to force back the cold poison in his body.

00:06:51.185 --> 00:06:53.345
But the Yushu Pill is a poison itself.

00:06:54.065 --> 00:06:55.625
One cannot cure poison with poison.

00:06:58.425 --> 00:07:00.145
Now that the cold poison has recurred,

00:07:01.705 --> 00:07:03.025
his qi is obstructed throughout all organs

00:07:03.785 --> 00:07:05.745
and both his heart and lungs
have been harmed.

00:07:08.665 --> 00:07:09.945
Xiao Huan.

00:07:11.425 --> 00:07:13.145
What happened? Are you all right?

00:07:17.385 --> 00:07:18.785
-Your Majesty.
-Xiao Huan.

00:07:19.985 --> 00:07:21.345
-Xiao Huan. What's wrong?
-Your Majesty.

00:07:22.545 --> 00:07:23.385
Are you all right?

00:07:23.465 --> 00:07:24.625
Your Majesty.

00:07:24.705 --> 00:07:26.505
Don't scare me.

00:07:27.545 --> 00:07:29.585
Are you all right?
What's happening to him?

00:07:30.345 --> 00:07:31.665
What's wrong with him?

00:07:32.265 --> 00:07:33.105
His condition

00:07:35.545 --> 00:07:37.025
is extremely grave.

00:07:37.705 --> 00:07:40.945
No. Think of something. Quick!

00:07:41.025 --> 00:07:42.145
I told you before.

00:07:42.665 --> 00:07:45.945
Frost Reed is the only antidote for him.
He gave it to you.

00:07:47.545 --> 00:07:50.185
No. No.

00:07:50.265 --> 00:07:51.625
No, I don't want it.

00:07:53.105 --> 00:07:56.265
I don't want it.
I don't know any antidote.

00:07:59.345 --> 00:08:00.305
Xiao Huan.

00:08:04.385 --> 00:08:05.865
Xiao Huan!

00:08:05.945 --> 00:08:07.065
-Xiao Huan!
-Cangcang.

00:08:07.145 --> 00:08:08.625
-Cangcang.
-Wake up!

00:08:08.705 --> 00:08:09.545
Look at this.

00:08:13.025 --> 00:08:14.105
What is this?

00:08:14.185 --> 00:08:15.985
I went to an old shaman and begged
for this medicinal bath prescription.

00:08:16.065 --> 00:08:17.305
He once used this

00:08:17.385 --> 00:08:18.825
to save soldiers afflicted
with cold poison.

00:08:18.905 --> 00:08:20.305
Take a look. Will this work?

00:08:21.665 --> 00:08:22.705
Preceptor Du.

00:08:26.465 --> 00:08:27.305
This prescription

00:08:27.905 --> 00:08:29.385
does have its uses.

00:08:30.145 --> 00:08:31.585
But His Majesty's poison
has reached his lungs.

00:08:31.665 --> 00:08:32.505
I'm not sure if…

00:08:32.585 --> 00:08:34.705
There's no time. Hurry.

00:08:35.345 --> 00:08:36.865
-Try it.
-Guards!

00:08:37.705 --> 00:08:39.225
-Yes.
-Prepare a bath barrel.

00:08:39.305 --> 00:08:40.425
Boil the medicine
according to the prescription.

00:08:40.505 --> 00:08:41.345
Yes!

00:08:47.585 --> 00:08:48.585
Xiao Huan.

00:10:21.145 --> 00:10:21.985
Cangcang,

00:10:22.625 --> 00:10:24.905
I know you've misunderstood me
many times before.

00:10:25.465 --> 00:10:28.745
Will you give me a chance to start over?

00:10:30.625 --> 00:10:32.385
I'll stay by your side

00:10:32.985 --> 00:10:35.065
until the day you're willing
to walk toward me.

00:11:06.025 --> 00:11:08.825
POST STATION

00:11:16.985 --> 00:11:17.905
It's hot.

00:12:47.745 --> 00:12:48.905
The fever finally broke.

00:12:53.105 --> 00:12:53.985
Xiao Huan.

00:12:59.985 --> 00:13:00.865
Xiao Huan.

00:13:05.465 --> 00:13:06.345
Xiao Huan.

00:13:08.945 --> 00:13:09.985
Why hasn't he woken up yet?

00:13:19.225 --> 00:13:20.345
His heartbeat is fast.

00:13:23.745 --> 00:13:25.705
Did the poison reach his lungs?

00:13:28.985 --> 00:13:29.985
Xiao Huan.

00:13:30.065 --> 00:13:31.625
Don't scare me.

00:13:35.865 --> 00:13:38.105
Xiao Huan. Xiao Huan!

00:13:38.825 --> 00:13:40.465
Wake up, Xiao Huan!

00:13:40.545 --> 00:13:41.985
You can't die.

00:13:42.065 --> 00:13:44.585
Xiao Huan. I won't blame you anymore.

00:13:44.665 --> 00:13:47.425
I won't scold you anymore.
I won't resent you anymore.

00:13:47.505 --> 00:13:50.105
Wake up. You can't die. Xiao Huan!

00:13:50.185 --> 00:13:51.225
I'm not dead.

00:13:56.025 --> 00:13:57.505
You're awake.

00:13:58.545 --> 00:13:59.825
I'm fine.

00:14:00.705 --> 00:14:01.545
Really?

00:14:03.265 --> 00:14:04.105
Don't lie to me.

00:14:05.065 --> 00:14:06.985
Even if I had died,

00:14:07.065 --> 00:14:08.705
keeping you safe

00:14:08.785 --> 00:14:09.625
would've been worth it.

00:14:24.385 --> 00:14:26.385
POST STATION

00:14:26.465 --> 00:14:27.825
You've just started to recover.

00:14:27.905 --> 00:14:29.985
Make sure you don't catch a chill again.

00:14:32.625 --> 00:14:33.545
All right.

00:14:43.545 --> 00:14:44.465
Your Majesty, you're finally awake.

00:14:54.025 --> 00:14:55.425
I suddenly feel like
eating pear blossom honey.

00:14:56.305 --> 00:14:58.825
Great. Preceptor Du can check my pulse.

00:14:59.505 --> 00:15:00.785
Go get it for me.

00:15:05.625 --> 00:15:06.465
Sure.

00:15:10.465 --> 00:15:11.985
His Majesty's poisoned veins have eased
these past few days.

00:15:12.065 --> 00:15:13.545
Please examine him again, Preceptor Du.

00:15:35.705 --> 00:15:36.785
Do you know

00:15:37.825 --> 00:15:39.505
why I asked you to stay?

00:15:43.505 --> 00:15:44.345
I don't know, Your Majesty.

00:15:45.345 --> 00:15:46.265
Let me ask you.

00:15:47.105 --> 00:15:47.985
When Kumor forced you

00:15:48.665 --> 00:15:51.025
to choose between
the Phoenix Seal and the Empress,

00:15:51.105 --> 00:15:54.465
why did you take the Phoenix Seal
and leave the Empress behind?

00:16:05.065 --> 00:16:06.345
It was a lapse in judgment.

00:16:07.265 --> 00:16:08.225
Please punish me.

00:16:10.465 --> 00:16:12.305
We grew up together.

00:16:12.905 --> 00:16:14.585
Don't lie to me.

00:16:22.625 --> 00:16:24.585
Do you really want the truth?

00:16:26.025 --> 00:16:26.945
Of course.

00:16:34.105 --> 00:16:35.065
Because I think

00:16:35.145 --> 00:16:37.185
the Empress

00:16:37.265 --> 00:16:38.745
is a threat to you.

00:16:40.265 --> 00:16:42.345
-Du Tingxin!
-You're the Emperor.

00:16:42.425 --> 00:16:44.625
The entire Great Qi rests on you.

00:16:45.825 --> 00:16:46.905
But Ling Cangcang

00:16:47.865 --> 00:16:49.705
has dragged you into danger
again and again.

00:16:51.505 --> 00:16:52.345
I'd rather

00:16:53.065 --> 00:16:55.705
she never return to your side.

00:16:58.305 --> 00:16:59.705
Do you hear yourself?

00:17:03.025 --> 00:17:05.065
Everything I've done is for Great Qi

00:17:05.985 --> 00:17:07.224
and for Your Majesty.

00:17:08.625 --> 00:17:09.545
I

00:17:10.905 --> 00:17:12.665
-have no regrets.
-Du Tingxin!

00:17:18.345 --> 00:17:19.224
Your Majesty.

00:17:20.785 --> 00:17:21.665
Your Majesty.

00:17:23.825 --> 00:17:24.704
Preceptor Du,

00:17:25.944 --> 00:17:27.704
you've completed the peace negotiation.

00:17:28.464 --> 00:17:30.825
Leave the Phoenix Seal here
and return to the Capital at once.

00:17:37.025 --> 00:17:38.665
I'm worried about your health.

00:17:42.345 --> 00:17:44.105
I can't return to the Capital.

00:17:46.665 --> 00:17:48.265
The Empress is with me.

00:17:49.025 --> 00:17:49.865
That's enough.

00:17:55.585 --> 00:17:57.145
Your pulse is weak.

00:17:58.545 --> 00:18:00.425
You'll fall into longer sleeps

00:18:01.465 --> 00:18:02.785
from now on.

00:18:06.865 --> 00:18:08.945
Please consider your health

00:18:11.665 --> 00:18:13.345
and allow me to stay by your side.

00:18:14.745 --> 00:18:15.785
There are others in this world

00:18:16.505 --> 00:18:17.785
who can treat me,

00:18:18.705 --> 00:18:19.545
not just you.

00:18:21.265 --> 00:18:22.465
But my empress

00:18:23.185 --> 00:18:24.145
can only be Ling Cangcang.

00:18:24.945 --> 00:18:25.905
Your Majesty,

00:18:26.745 --> 00:18:28.345
you'd even throw your life away

00:18:29.985 --> 00:18:31.545
for Ling Cangcang?

00:18:33.705 --> 00:18:34.985
Is it worth it?

00:18:37.665 --> 00:18:40.505
Preceptor Du, this is not your concern.

00:18:41.705 --> 00:18:42.545
You may leave.

00:19:17.025 --> 00:19:17.905
Your Majesty.

00:19:20.665 --> 00:19:23.025
The grievances between
you and Her Majesty have lasted for years.

00:19:24.425 --> 00:19:25.985
Even if you've reconciled,

00:19:27.185 --> 00:19:28.865
how long can it really last?

00:19:30.905 --> 00:19:32.985
Do you truly believe

00:19:33.065 --> 00:19:34.305
that Ling Cangcang

00:19:35.305 --> 00:19:37.065
will stay by your side

00:19:37.145 --> 00:19:38.785
without resentment at all?

00:20:05.185 --> 00:20:07.305
Xiao Huan, look.

00:20:07.385 --> 00:20:08.785
Look what I brought you.

00:20:10.705 --> 00:20:11.745
You're sleeping?

00:20:13.465 --> 00:20:14.385
I'm just a little tired.

00:20:20.905 --> 00:20:22.505
You're tired now?

00:20:24.025 --> 00:20:26.105
It's late. Aren't you tired?

00:20:28.705 --> 00:20:29.745
I'm not.

00:20:30.905 --> 00:20:31.745
Look.

00:20:32.505 --> 00:20:34.665
The weather in Jiangzhou is so cold
that we can make ice lanterns now.

00:20:35.265 --> 00:20:36.985
I got a crystal lantern for you.

00:20:37.905 --> 00:20:38.945
Is it beautiful?

00:20:40.105 --> 00:20:41.545
It is.

00:20:41.625 --> 00:20:43.865
I'm thinking, once you get better,

00:20:43.945 --> 00:20:45.465
I'll take you to see ice lanterns.
How does that sound?

00:20:47.065 --> 00:20:47.905
Great.

00:20:55.945 --> 00:20:56.985
What's wrong?

00:20:58.665 --> 00:20:59.705
Nothing.

00:21:03.585 --> 00:21:05.865
I was just thinking,

00:21:05.945 --> 00:21:07.785
life here is harsher than in the palace.

00:21:08.385 --> 00:21:10.185
Maybe
we should return to the Capital soon.

00:21:12.345 --> 00:21:13.185
We?

00:21:14.785 --> 00:21:17.865
You mean you and I return together?

00:21:23.905 --> 00:21:25.465
Physician Li said

00:21:25.545 --> 00:21:28.225
a good mood helps my condition.

00:21:29.825 --> 00:21:31.345
What will make you happy?

00:21:32.265 --> 00:21:34.425
I'll tell you tomorrow.

00:21:37.025 --> 00:21:37.945
For now…

00:21:40.865 --> 00:21:41.905
For now,

00:21:41.985 --> 00:21:43.905
let's have a good rest.

00:21:47.945 --> 00:21:49.465
Your pulse is weak.

00:21:51.025 --> 00:21:52.945
You'll fall into longer sleeps

00:21:53.745 --> 00:21:55.305
from now on.

00:22:16.705 --> 00:22:18.225
Your Highness, we've reached Mount Xiandu.

00:22:34.785 --> 00:22:35.625
Your Highness,

00:22:36.225 --> 00:22:38.865
Physician Li is at the post station ahead.
Shall I go with you?

00:22:38.945 --> 00:22:39.865
No need.

00:22:41.825 --> 00:22:43.545
The incident in Xuzhou

00:22:44.345 --> 00:22:45.825
must be related to Ling Xuefeng.

00:22:47.465 --> 00:22:50.705
These guards may not all be trustworthy.

00:22:51.465 --> 00:22:54.025
Watch them closely.
No one is allowed to leave.

00:22:54.105 --> 00:22:55.585
Anyone who disobeys

00:22:56.545 --> 00:22:58.505
-will be punished under military law.
-Yes, Your Highness.

00:23:03.505 --> 00:23:06.385
Your Majesty, I'm leaving.

00:23:06.465 --> 00:23:07.785
Won't you see me off?

00:23:08.385 --> 00:23:09.665
From now on,

00:23:09.745 --> 00:23:11.585
you'll be the lord governing
your own land.

00:23:12.145 --> 00:23:13.825
Stop acting recklessly.

00:23:15.065 --> 00:23:16.065
Before I leave,

00:23:16.785 --> 00:23:18.185
I beg you

00:23:18.265 --> 00:23:20.305
to give me the map of Great Qi

00:23:21.425 --> 00:23:22.505
painted by Father.

00:23:24.225 --> 00:23:25.825
That's something he left behind.

00:23:26.585 --> 00:23:29.025
I want to keep it as a remembrance.

00:23:33.105 --> 00:23:34.465
That map

00:23:35.025 --> 00:23:37.065
records the lands, mountains, and rivers

00:23:37.145 --> 00:23:38.705
of Great Qi.

00:23:39.545 --> 00:23:41.025
Are you asking for it

00:23:41.105 --> 00:23:42.625
to tell me

00:23:43.265 --> 00:23:44.625
you still haven't given up the throne?

00:23:46.905 --> 00:23:48.065
Bear this in mind.

00:23:48.945 --> 00:23:50.345
As long as I'm alive,

00:23:51.225 --> 00:23:54.065
that map will never go to you.

00:23:57.425 --> 00:23:59.665
You may open this pouch

00:24:00.385 --> 00:24:01.585
when the time is right.

00:24:18.625 --> 00:24:21.265
All right. Stop trying.

00:24:21.945 --> 00:24:22.785
It's a dead knot.

00:24:22.865 --> 00:24:26.625
How dare you kidnap me?
Why are you tying me up?

00:24:27.625 --> 00:24:30.105
Don't think you can act outrageously

00:24:30.185 --> 00:24:32.745
just because His Majesty named you Regent.

00:24:32.825 --> 00:24:35.145
Li, be honest with me.

00:24:36.025 --> 00:24:37.585
Can His Majesty

00:24:38.665 --> 00:24:40.145
be cured?

00:24:42.345 --> 00:24:44.425
If he didn't know his days were numbered,

00:24:44.945 --> 00:24:46.585
why would he give me the map?

00:24:47.185 --> 00:24:48.265
The Frost Reed

00:24:48.345 --> 00:24:50.825
that could save his life has been used,

00:24:50.905 --> 00:24:54.625
but I have found a way
to replace it with Frost Blossom.

00:24:54.705 --> 00:24:58.345
With Frost Blossom, I can keep His Majesty
safe for at least ten more years.

00:24:59.705 --> 00:25:00.545
Really?

00:25:06.025 --> 00:25:07.425
If I find the Frost Blossom,

00:25:08.625 --> 00:25:09.545
Huan,

00:25:10.385 --> 00:25:13.025
your life will be in my hands.

00:25:31.585 --> 00:25:35.105
Frost Reed and Frost Blossom
come from the same origin,

00:25:35.185 --> 00:25:37.345
but they grow in different places,

00:25:37.425 --> 00:25:39.825
so their medicinal natures differ.

00:25:41.465 --> 00:25:44.345
Still, I've found a way

00:25:44.425 --> 00:25:47.265
to cure the cold poison
with Frost Blossom.

00:25:47.345 --> 00:25:49.185
It favors shade and cold,

00:25:49.265 --> 00:25:51.865
and mostly grows on cliffs.

00:25:51.945 --> 00:25:54.185
It withers within half a day.

00:25:54.265 --> 00:25:56.865
Bee-eaters nest in cliffside rocks.

00:25:57.585 --> 00:26:00.305
The males often carry
Frost Blossom while courting,

00:26:00.385 --> 00:26:03.305
dropping seeds
in their nests on the cliffs.

00:26:03.945 --> 00:26:07.905
Someone once saw bee-eaters on
the cliffs of Mount Xiandu.

00:26:08.585 --> 00:26:09.985
Follow the birds,

00:26:10.065 --> 00:26:13.305
and you may find Frost Blossom.

00:26:17.945 --> 00:26:21.585
Was Physician Li trying to fool me?

00:27:09.025 --> 00:27:09.865
Who's that?

00:27:41.785 --> 00:27:43.505
Well, well, Xiao Huan.

00:27:44.145 --> 00:27:46.665
Your life is in my hands now.

00:28:17.105 --> 00:28:18.025
Xiao Huan.

00:28:20.185 --> 00:28:23.145
If I die here,

00:28:23.225 --> 00:28:25.105
I'll haunt you even as a ghost.

00:28:46.585 --> 00:28:47.785
Why is it you?

00:29:11.945 --> 00:29:14.505
Didn't I set you free?

00:29:15.425 --> 00:29:16.385
Why did you come back?

00:29:27.225 --> 00:29:28.625
You spared me once,

00:29:28.705 --> 00:29:30.185
and I'm saving you now.

00:29:35.385 --> 00:29:36.745
We're even.

00:29:36.825 --> 00:29:38.385
I told you to leave, and you didn't.

00:29:39.185 --> 00:29:41.065
I've changed my mind now.

00:29:41.985 --> 00:29:43.185
I'm not letting you go.

00:29:45.345 --> 00:29:46.345
What do you mean?

00:29:46.425 --> 00:29:47.665
What do I mean?

00:29:48.625 --> 00:29:50.865
I can't just leave you on this mountain

00:29:50.945 --> 00:29:52.065
as wolves' food.

00:30:20.065 --> 00:30:21.185
Why did you save me?

00:30:24.665 --> 00:30:25.505
I didn't mean to save you.

00:30:26.905 --> 00:30:28.425
I just happened to run into you.

00:30:29.025 --> 00:30:30.505
Why are you still denying it now?

00:30:38.545 --> 00:30:39.385
Eat this.

00:30:39.465 --> 00:30:41.265
This is the Blood-Replenishing Pill.

00:30:41.345 --> 00:30:42.425
It'll help your wounds.

00:31:03.665 --> 00:31:05.625
Where are you heading to?
I'll give you a ride.

00:31:12.825 --> 00:31:14.625
Could it be you can't bear to leave me,

00:31:15.225 --> 00:31:17.665
and plan to cling to me for life?

00:31:28.305 --> 00:31:29.225
Wait.

00:31:29.305 --> 00:31:30.625
What… What's wrong?

00:31:31.825 --> 00:31:33.505
Why are you crying? No.

00:31:33.585 --> 00:31:36.425
I… I didn't mean that.
I'm not saying you can't follow me.

00:31:39.345 --> 00:31:40.865
I know you're injured,

00:31:41.465 --> 00:31:42.465
so I was worried…

00:31:43.745 --> 00:31:45.145
No. That's not what I meant.

00:31:46.905 --> 00:31:47.825
Master Zhong.

00:31:47.905 --> 00:31:50.145
Miss Zhong. Vice Sect Leader Zhong.

00:31:51.505 --> 00:31:52.545
It's my fault.

00:31:52.625 --> 00:31:55.305
I shouldn't have stabbed you.
I shouldn't have driven you away.

00:31:55.385 --> 00:31:57.625
It's all my fault. How about this?

00:31:58.225 --> 00:31:59.105
Here.

00:31:59.185 --> 00:32:01.465
You stab me too. Just not the face.

00:32:02.265 --> 00:32:04.785
Don't ruin my beautiful face.

00:32:05.905 --> 00:32:07.465
I don't want to!

00:32:07.545 --> 00:32:10.105
Uh. How about this?

00:32:10.185 --> 00:32:11.425
Hit me.

00:32:12.105 --> 00:32:13.065
Hit my face.

00:32:13.145 --> 00:32:14.065
Come on. Hit me.

00:32:15.105 --> 00:32:16.185
You see,

00:32:16.265 --> 00:32:18.825
no one has ever hit my face.

00:32:19.585 --> 00:32:22.345
You'll be the first and only. Hit me.

00:32:22.425 --> 00:32:23.825
Come on. Hit me.

00:32:23.905 --> 00:32:25.305
Go on. Hit me. Hit me.

00:32:48.785 --> 00:32:49.705
I'm crying

00:32:50.865 --> 00:32:51.865
because the world is so big,

00:32:53.185 --> 00:32:54.985
but I have nowhere to go.

00:32:55.585 --> 00:32:57.545
Didn't you always talk about
wanting to see Ling Cangcang?

00:32:58.145 --> 00:32:59.785
How would I face Cangcang?

00:33:00.625 --> 00:33:03.505
How would I explain to her?

00:33:03.585 --> 00:33:05.545
If you have something you can't tell her,

00:33:05.625 --> 00:33:07.185
you can tell me.

00:33:08.985 --> 00:33:09.825
Who are you really?

00:33:12.225 --> 00:33:13.905
I don't want to die
without knowing the truth.

00:33:25.585 --> 00:33:27.505
I was rescued by Master Li Lu

00:33:27.585 --> 00:33:30.105
from the Saintess of Lingbi Sect.

00:33:30.785 --> 00:33:32.225
After I left with him,

00:33:33.145 --> 00:33:34.505
he only gave me one task.

00:33:35.105 --> 00:33:37.305
No matter what happens,

00:33:37.385 --> 00:33:39.145
protect Cangcang.

00:33:39.665 --> 00:33:40.905
Even if it costs your life.

00:33:43.185 --> 00:33:45.465
-Master!
-Cangcang.

00:33:48.265 --> 00:33:51.585
Zhong Lin was an orphan
I picked up somewhere.

00:33:51.665 --> 00:33:52.545
I kept her with us.

00:33:53.145 --> 00:33:54.825
From now on, she'll stay by your side,

00:33:54.905 --> 00:33:56.425
-all right?
-All right.

00:33:57.185 --> 00:33:59.705
Don't be afraid.
I'll protect you from now on.

00:34:02.945 --> 00:34:04.425
I never harmed Cangcang,

00:34:05.705 --> 00:34:06.905
nor did I disobey my master.

00:34:06.985 --> 00:34:09.025
Before Master Li Lu died,

00:34:09.105 --> 00:34:11.304
he told me that from then on,

00:34:11.385 --> 00:34:13.065
I only had to obey Cangcang.

00:34:15.425 --> 00:34:16.264
I'm afraid…

00:34:16.865 --> 00:34:18.585
You failed me.

00:34:18.665 --> 00:34:20.625
What does this have to do
with Ling Cangcang?

00:34:20.705 --> 00:34:22.505
I didn't even blame you.

00:34:25.784 --> 00:34:26.985
Xiao Qianqing,

00:34:28.304 --> 00:34:29.465
I'm sorry.

00:34:31.225 --> 00:34:33.625
I killed you because it was
the order of Lingbi Sect's guardian.

00:34:33.705 --> 00:34:35.185
He came after you.

00:34:35.865 --> 00:34:38.545
If he still fails to kill you,
he won't stop.

00:34:39.145 --> 00:34:40.865
Lingbi Sect may be divided,

00:34:40.945 --> 00:34:44.665
but when it comes to killing,
they never leave a loose end.

00:34:47.744 --> 00:34:49.304
So,

00:34:49.385 --> 00:34:51.824
could you maybe shelter me for a while?

00:34:54.545 --> 00:34:56.385
I can protect you, after all.

00:34:59.145 --> 00:35:00.665
Forget it. You protect me?

00:35:00.745 --> 00:35:01.585
I think it's the other way around.

00:35:04.665 --> 00:35:07.185
Right. You protect me.

00:35:08.985 --> 00:35:11.985
Stop pulling the long face. It's ugly.

00:35:13.945 --> 00:35:15.705
Come on. Smile for me.

00:35:17.265 --> 00:35:19.785
Get off. I'm being serious.

00:35:22.105 --> 00:35:23.945
I'm going to Jiangzhou to find Xiao Huan.

00:35:24.545 --> 00:35:25.665
I'll take you to Ling Cangcang.

00:35:26.945 --> 00:35:28.625
If anything happens,

00:35:29.465 --> 00:35:30.385
I'll take the blame for you.

00:36:46.585 --> 00:36:49.545
NANRONG PALACE

00:37:23.585 --> 00:37:24.545
Preceptor Du,

00:37:25.265 --> 00:37:27.105
you've completed the peace negotiation.

00:37:27.865 --> 00:37:30.105
Leave the Phoenix Seal here
and return to the Capital at once.

00:37:31.145 --> 00:37:32.785
The Empress is with me.

00:37:33.625 --> 00:37:34.585
That's enough.

00:37:36.465 --> 00:37:37.465
There are others in this world

00:37:38.105 --> 00:37:39.705
who can treat me,

00:37:40.385 --> 00:37:41.825
not just you.

00:37:43.025 --> 00:37:44.305
But my empress

00:37:44.945 --> 00:37:46.345
can only be Ling Cangcang.

00:37:56.945 --> 00:37:59.465
Madam, General Lu requests an audience.

00:38:02.385 --> 00:38:03.225
Bring him in.

00:38:03.945 --> 00:38:04.825
Yes, Madam.

00:38:32.585 --> 00:38:33.625
Preceptor Du.

00:38:34.425 --> 00:38:35.345
General Lu,

00:38:36.225 --> 00:38:37.225
have a seat.

00:38:50.545 --> 00:38:51.505
What brings you here?

00:38:54.945 --> 00:38:56.345
Preceptor Du,

00:38:56.425 --> 00:38:57.705
after I return to the Capital,

00:38:57.785 --> 00:38:59.545
I must report to Commander Li

00:38:59.625 --> 00:39:01.545
on my mission to Jiangzhou.

00:39:02.705 --> 00:39:04.785
I came to ask for your guidance.

00:39:04.865 --> 00:39:06.985
You should speak honestly in the report.

00:39:07.065 --> 00:39:08.345
There's no need to come here
to ask about it.

00:39:19.545 --> 00:39:21.465
Along the journey,

00:39:22.265 --> 00:39:24.305
I had the honor

00:39:24.385 --> 00:39:25.985
to accompany you.

00:39:28.265 --> 00:39:30.585
I will remember what I saw and heard
for the rest of my life.

00:39:33.385 --> 00:39:34.665
I know

00:39:34.745 --> 00:39:36.745
you bear heavy duties

00:39:36.825 --> 00:39:37.905
and great burdens.

00:39:39.505 --> 00:39:42.145
It will be my honor to serve you
in any small way.

00:39:58.985 --> 00:40:00.105
General Lu.

00:40:01.385 --> 00:40:02.505
Yes, Madam.

00:40:03.145 --> 00:40:06.945
Do you mean the meaning of "Nanrong"?

00:40:11.705 --> 00:40:12.905
I do not, Madam.

00:40:14.585 --> 00:40:15.945
"Loyal to the Divine.

00:40:16.545 --> 00:40:17.585
If tainted by mortal desire,

00:40:18.785 --> 00:40:20.385
Heaven and Earth will not tolerate it."

00:40:30.905 --> 00:40:31.985
I understand now.

00:40:33.305 --> 00:40:36.065
Then I won't disturb
your peace any further, Madam.

00:40:36.665 --> 00:40:37.865
I'll take my leave.

00:40:42.305 --> 00:40:43.385
Hold on.

00:40:50.985 --> 00:40:52.425
I see by your complexion

00:40:52.505 --> 00:40:54.225
that you're sleeping lightly
and dreaming much.

00:40:55.225 --> 00:40:56.145
I'll have a palace maid

00:40:56.225 --> 00:40:58.665
fetch some incense
and tonic pills for you.

00:40:59.305 --> 00:41:00.225
You may come here

00:41:00.905 --> 00:41:02.465
to collect them every month.

00:41:05.985 --> 00:41:06.945
Thank you, Madam.

00:41:24.705 --> 00:41:25.585
Madam,

00:41:26.825 --> 00:41:29.425
restrain yourself.
Don't indulge wild thoughts.

00:41:46.945 --> 00:41:48.385
KUMOR ARMY HAS WITHDRAWN.
JIANGZHOU WON.

00:41:48.465 --> 00:41:49.745
I SPECIALLY SENT YOU THIS NOTE,
FATHER. CANGCANG IS SAFE AND WELL.

00:41:49.825 --> 00:41:51.025
SHE'LL SOON RETURN WITH THE EMPEROR.
PLEASE TAKE CARE OF YOURSELF, FATHER

00:41:51.105 --> 00:41:52.345
FROM JUEDING

00:41:55.545 --> 00:41:56.945
-Butler.
-Yes, My Lord.

00:41:57.025 --> 00:42:00.585
Give Chongming Temple
one thousand liang for merit lamps.

00:42:01.265 --> 00:42:04.305
Also,
give one liang of silver to every servant.

00:42:05.785 --> 00:42:08.065
If they wish to go home,
grant them permission.

00:42:08.745 --> 00:42:09.585
My Lord,

00:42:10.345 --> 00:42:12.905
what has you in such high spirits?

00:42:13.505 --> 00:42:15.265
Jiangzhou won the battle.

00:42:16.065 --> 00:42:20.465
Jueding and Cangcang are safe.
Shouldn't we celebrate?

00:42:20.545 --> 00:42:21.865
-Yes.
-Also,

00:42:21.945 --> 00:42:24.105
contact the people of Jiangzhou.

00:42:24.185 --> 00:42:25.825
Watch the two siblings closely

00:42:25.905 --> 00:42:28.585
and report all of their movements
and every word

00:42:29.585 --> 00:42:32.025
-they speak to the Emperor.
-Yes, My Lord.

00:42:32.105 --> 00:42:32.985
You may leave.

00:42:38.905 --> 00:42:41.265
Very well. Excellent.

00:42:41.345 --> 00:42:44.665
BRUSH AND INK

00:42:44.745 --> 00:42:45.705
My Lord,

00:42:46.305 --> 00:42:47.705
I've failed your trust.

00:42:48.465 --> 00:42:50.225
I couldn't kill
the Prince of Yuzhang in Xuzhou.

00:42:50.305 --> 00:42:52.065
Please punish me,

00:42:52.145 --> 00:42:53.425
My Lord.

00:42:58.465 --> 00:43:01.505
Xiao Qianqing is a hard nut.

00:43:03.425 --> 00:43:05.465
There aren't many opportunities
to kill him.

00:43:06.225 --> 00:43:09.465
There's somewhere I need to be.
You don't have to follow me.

00:43:12.425 --> 00:43:14.865
Stay here and think carefully

00:43:16.025 --> 00:43:18.225
about how you fall short

00:43:19.265 --> 00:43:20.105
of Xianxue.